BT
/F1 14 Tf 18 TL 40 750 Td (QUY DINH DANG BAN SAN PHAM CHO NGUOI BAN SHOPEE) '
/F2 9 Tf 12 TL (Target Customer Role: seller) '
(Document Identifier: quy-dinh-dang-ban-san-pham) '
(Effective Date: 2026-01-01 | Version: 2.4 | Status: Active) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (1. OVERVIEW OF SELLER LISTING REGULATIONS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Van ban nay quy dinh cac tieu chuan, dieu kien va quy dinh bat buoc danh cho Nguoi ban) '
(khi dang tai, quan ly va kinh doanh san pham tren san thuong mai dien tu Shopee Vietnam.) '
(Tat ca Nguoi ban phai tuan thu Luat Thuong mai dien tu, Luat Bao ve quyen loi nguoi tieu dung) '
(va cac quy dinh phap luat hien hanh cua Nuoc Cong hoa Xa hoi Chu nghia Viet Nam.) '
(Viec dang ban san pham vi pham se dan den cac hinh thuc xu phat tu xoa san pham, cong diem) '
(sao qua ta den khoa tai khoan kinh doanh.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (2. PROHIBITED AND RESTRICTED PRODUCT LISTINGS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Nguoi ban khong duoc phep dang ban cac san pham thuoc danh muc cam hoac han che:) '
(a) Hang hoa cam theo quy dinh phap luat: Vu khi, quoc phong, ma tuy, phao hoa, thuc pham) '
(khong an toan ve sinh, dong vat hoang da nguy cap, bang dia co noi dung doc hai.) '
(b) Hang gia, hang nhai va vi pham thuong hieu (Counterfeit & Infringing Goods): San pham) '
(sao chep kieu dang, logo, ten thuong hieu cua cac nhan hang da duoc bao ho.) '
(c) San pham cam theo quy dinh Shopee: Ve so, dich vu tai chinh, vay tien, thuoc va thiet bi) '
(y te chuyen dung, hoa don, e-voucher khong hop le, tai khoan game ban quyen.) '
(d) San pham can giay phep dac biet: My pham, thuc pham chuc nang, thuc pham bao ve suc khoe,) '
(sua cho tre em duoi 24 thang tuoi can tai len day du Giay cong bo san pham va Giay phep.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (3. PRODUCT TITLE, IMAGES AND DESCRIPTION STANDARDS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Quy dinh chi tiet ve thong tin dang tai san pham:) '
(- Tieu de san pham (Product Title): Phai bat dau bang Ten san pham + Thuong hieu + Thong so.) '
(Tieu de phai viet bang tieng Viet co dau hoac tieng Anh. Khong chua tu khoa rac, khong gia danh.) '
(- Hinh anh va Video san pham: Hinh anh phai sac net, phan anh chinh xac san pham thuc te.) '
(Khong duoc dung hinh anh phan cam, khong chua thong tin/logo cua cac san TMDT doi thu.) '
(- Mo ta san pham: Cung cap thong tin chi tiet ve chat lieu, kich thuoc, xuat xu, huong dan.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (4. PRICE SETTING AND INVENTORY MANAGEMENT RULES) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Nguoi ban phai tuan thu cac quy dinh ve gia va quan ly ton kho:) '
(- Niem yet gia minh bach: Gia san pham phai niem yet bang Dong Viet Nam (VND), bao gom) '
(tat ca cac khoan thue ap dung. Nghiem cam dang gia 0 dong, gia ao hoac khac xa gia tri.) '
(- Hanh vi tang gia roi giam gia (Spam Discount): Nghiem cam hanh vi tang gia san pham len cao) '
(ngay truoc khi tham gia chuong trinh khuyen mai roi thuc hien giam gia ao.) '
(- Cap nhat ton kho chinh xac: Nguoi ban phai thuong xuyen cap nhat so luong ton kho thuc te.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (5. PENALTY POINTS SYSTEM AND ENFORCEMENT MEASURES) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Shopee ap dung He thong Diem Sao Qua Ta de quan ly vi pham cua Nguoi ban:) '
(- Ty le don hang giao tre va Ty le don khong hoan thanh: Neu vuot qua muc quy dinh 10%,) '
(Nguoi ban se bi cong tu 1 den 2 diem sao qua ta moi tuan.) '
(- Dang ban san pham vi pham: Moi san pham vi pham danh muc cam hoac hang gia se bi xoa va) '
(Nguoi ban bi cong 2 den 4 diem sao qua ta.) '
(- Cac muc do xu phat theo Sao Qua Ta:) '
(  + 3 diem: Tam dung tham gia cac chuong trinh khuyen mai trong 28 ngay.) '
(  + 6 diem: Tuoc danh hieu Shopee Mall / Shop Yeu thich va han che hien thi san pham.) '
(  + 9 diem: Ban quyen dang ban san pham moi.) '
(  + 12 diem tro len: Tuoc quyen truy cap va khoa tai khoan kinh doanh tam thoi hoac vinh vien.) '
